SUMMARY:The Truth about Lies: Passing the Test of Fear Versus Love 
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nWhat in the world 
 is going on with all the lies?! Reality is getting stretched to a breaking
  point! One major sign of planet Earth on the brink of both disaster and r
 ebirth is the prevalence of distressing lies. People are making crazy dang
 erous self-sabotaging decisions based on false negative ideas\, paranoid p
 aradigms\, and broken belief systems. To rational folks this makes no sens
 e\; is humanity really going to destroy itself over bad thinking? Is there
  an epidemic of mental illness at the end of history? We must understand t
 he trend to save ourselves.\n\nJoin us Sunday Aug 23\, 2026 for a free hea
 rt-opening mind-healing explanation for what’s really happening. You’r
 e free to disagree and think I’m just another crazy\, but this is what I
  and many other were trained for. The crisis is spiritual\, providing evid
 ence that reality is not physically objective but rather a simulation base
 d in consciousness. What’s the difference? Well\, if reality was solid a
 nd objective\, then people would agree on what works best in a cooperative
  healthy society. After all\, we come from nature which thrives in pragmat
 ic life systems. But humans have freewill to go off the rails. People can 
 choose to think false negative beliefs that block intuition\, corrupt reas
 oning\, distress emotions\, and spread disease. Most people will agree the
 re are some really wrong sick subcultures out there\, but then they’ll j
 ust point the finger at each other.\n\nDon’t worry\, humans aren’t bad
  and we didn’t invent negativity. The challenge is what any sentient cre
 ator species will face in the evolution of their consciousness: how to han
 dle lies and false promises. The devil lies. The devil is a religious arch
 etype\, and religion is just early psychology. This is the narcissist in m
 odern psychology\, the fascist in politics\, and the negative ego in spiri
 tuality. We’re talking about a judgmental alter ego that says do what’
 s bad for you claiming that it’s good\, and don’t do what’s good for
  you because that will be so bad. The classic devil is a pathological liar
  who inverts the truth in ways that are both crippling to ignore and empow
 ering to catch.\n\nSome therapies say there are “no bad parts”\, that 
 every aspect of you is well-intentioned and can be helped to heal. Well\, 
 that’s true enough for the real living sides of your personality. But th
 e devil is different\; it’s an artificial unreal parasite that fades awa
 y on its own. Negativity is a destructive impulse that keeps people in con
 flict to feed itself. Negative behavior is anti-life\, causing pain and su
 ffering\, so people must be deceived to practice it. The greatest triumph 
 of negativity is convincing people to generate more negativity to stop neg
 ativity\, thus keeping it alive. We see this in worst cycles of violence a
 nd revenge. The demagogue provokes our emotions to take advantage of our c
 haos\, at least until we understand the game.\n\nSo why does destructive f
 alse information exist in an otherwise perfect Creation? This is exactly b
 ecause reality is not objective but rather a subjective exercise in creato
 r consciousness. Everyone needs to evolve for increasing individuation\, t
 o become a self-leader and not just another follower. Depending on the cul
 ture\, individuals may choose to step out of the harmony of nature in orde
 r to experience the consequences of specific choices and learn to step bac
 k in more consciously. Being negative may have become glorified in pop cul
 ture as a cool edgy dark lifestyle. But real negativity is just unconsciou
 s suicidal stupidity\, from which we need to wake up to become more wise a
 nd self-aware than ever.\n\nFor this meetup\, ask yourself how well you’
 re coping with the levels of deceit and cruelty in the world today. Are yo
 u willing to do the “shadow work”\, to find root causes in the self\, 
 to change paradigms and heal forever? I’ll explain how consciousness evo
 lves naturally to learn to discern its own best path back to the Source pa
 radise. The domination culture is fear-based\, which means that fear is sp
 read by distressing lies to keep people choosing violence over love. You
 ’ll see exactly when a negative ego develops in reality creation\, and h
 ow to choose the positive direction out of every problem to reclaim your p
 ower as a loved and loving cocreator with the greater multiverse. We’ll 
 conclude with a guided meditation to release the lies that kept us sufferi
 ng in negativity\, so we can be guided by our higher self to live happy ev
 er after.\n\nWelcome! Our Inner Selves Mastery spiritual support group is 
 free online every Sunday 11am-130pm EDT\, with the last 30 minutes for a g
 uided meditation. If you can’t stay you can get the recording. You can s
 ignup here for this meeting and visit www.signupISM.com for all events\, n
 ewsletter\, videos\, and more.\n\nBest wishes\,\nCarl Johann Schroeder\nIn
 ner Selves Mastery\nspiritual teaching and coaching\nquick-links at [www.s
 ignupISM.com](http://www.signupISM.com)
