SUMMARY:Learn to dance Salsa 💃🏿 4 week series 
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nLearn to Dance Sal
 sa with Salsa4Life at La Luz Dance Co Studio in Raleigh!💃🕺\n\nNo par
 tner? No problem! Two left feet?\nWe've got you covered. Join Clara\, Giov
 anni and Michael of Salsa4Life for a fun\, beginner-friendly Salsa dance c
 ourse held every Tuesday starting Sept 1st at 8pm!\n\n💥 What to Expect:
 \nPerfect for absolute beginners\nLearn the rhythm\, timing\, and basic fo
 otwork of Salsa\nGet introduced to partner dancing\nA progressive 4-week c
 ourse – each week builds on the last\nA fun\, welcoming environment that
  encourages community and connection.\n\n📍 Location:\n213 Fayetteville 
 St. Suite 202\, 2nd floor\, Raleigh\, NC 27601\nFree street parking in gar
 ages and street.\n\n📅 Schedule: Every Tuesday (Sep 1- 22)\n🕖 8:00 PM
  – 9:00 PM\n💵 Pricing: $75 pp or $130 for two for 4 classes\n\n🎟
 ️ Register online: www.Salsa4Life.com\n(Online registration required due
  to limited space. No refunds after first class is taken.)\n\n👟 What to
  Bring: Comfortable clothing\nNon-rubber sole shoes (for easier movement)\
 nAges: 18 to 99\n📞 Questions? Text or Call 804-651-8117\n✨ Come out a
 nd shake those hips !✨
